1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  (b. 1612, d. 1666)
2 CONT
2 CONT NB: M.D. is not part of my name.
2 CONT
2 CONT William Hans Kierstede was born 1612 in Magdeburg, Saxony, Germany and died 1666 in Kingston, New York. He married Sara Roelofs Jans on 1642 in Kingston, New York daughter of Roelof Jans and Anneke Jans.
2 CONT
2 CONT [Brøderbund WFT Vol. 2, Ed. 1, Tree #0935, Date of Import: Feb 10, 2000]
2 CONT
2 CONT Accompanied Governor William Kieft to New Amsterdam in March, 1638.
2 CONT
2 CONT • signed the [http://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000031153339775 '''Remonstrance'''] to surrender New Netherland (1664)
2 CONT
2 CONT More About William Hans Kierstede:
2 CONT
2 CONT Date born 2: WFT Est. 1597-162666
2 CONT
2 CONT Date born 3: WFT Est. 1597-1626, Holland.  ? alternate birth than Magdeburg
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 2: WFT Est. 1647-171368
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 3: WFT Est. 1650-1712, Kingston, New York.69
2 CONT
2 CONT More About William Hans Kierstede and Sara Roelofs Jans:
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1: 1642, Kingston, New York.69
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 2: June 29, 164270
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 3: June 29, 1642, New Amsterdam, Dutch Ref Ch, NY.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of William Hans Kierstede and Sara Roelofs Jans are:
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Jochem Kierstede, b. WFT Est. 1638-166470, d. WFT Est. 1644-174870.
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. Lucas Kierstede, b. WFT Est. 1638-166470, d. WFT Est. 1644-174870.
2 CONT
2 CONT    3. Jacob Kierstede, b. WFT Est. 1638-166470, d. WFT Est. 1644-174570.
2 CONT
2 CONT    4. Rachel Kierstede, b. WFT Est. 1638-166470, d. WFT Est. 1644-174870.
2 CONT
2 CONT    5. +Roelof Kierstede, b. January 01, 1646/47, Kingston, New York71, d. WFT Est. 1680-1738, Kingston, New York (?)71.
2 CONT
2 CONT    6. +Catherine Kierstede, b. January 04, 1659/60, New Amsterdam, NY Dutch Ref Ch, d. WFT Est. 1705-1755, New Netherlands72.
2 CONT
2 CONT Created with Family Tree Maker
2 CONT
2 CONT http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/f/i/e/Phyllis-J-Fields/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0141.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr. Hans Kierstead  married Sara Roeloff in the Fort, N.Y.C. on June 29, 1642.  Sara was born in New Amsterdam and was baptized in 1634. They had 8 -10 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans Kierstead came to NYC in 1638 with Gov. Kieft in the service of the West India Company.  He was the first physician and surgeon to settle in NYC. They lived on [http://www.ekamper.net/gr-misc.htm '''Pearl Street'''] (corner o
2 CONC f Pearl and Whitehall) which was then on the waterfront of the East River.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sara later married Cornelius Van Boesum and had a third marriage with Elbert Elbertson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Doctor Hans Kierstede, of Magdeburg, who married, June 29, 1642, Sarah Roelofs, a daughter of Jans Roelofs by his marriage to the celebrated heiress, Anneka Jans.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.surnameguide.com/bayard/petrus_bayard_genealogy.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------
2 CONT
