2 CONT
2 CONT ......... + Marita Vermillye (1711 - after 1760) b: 12 May 1711 in New York, USA, m: Bef. 1730 in New Amsterdam, American Colony, (NY), d: Aft. 1760 in New Amsterdam, American Colony, (NY)
2 CONT
2 CONT ............4 John  Teller (1741 - 1830) b: 1741 in Croton Point, Westchester Co., NY, d: 23 Jun 1830 in Glenville, Clinton Co. NY
