1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Georg Wibbling (born 1578 in Lübeck - 1655 Sonderköping) married 1606 in Lübeck with  Magdalena Lembke (born before 1590 in Sonderköping, she died 1617 Sonderköping).
2 CONT
2 CONT source: Dirk Schäfer: DIE LEMBKES – "Geschichte einer Mecklenburger Familie" Das Buch erscheint in 2018 im MFP-Verlag-Tellow (gemeinnütziger Verlag des Vereins für Mecklenburgische Familien- und Personengeschichte e. V.)
2 CONT
2 CONT "DIE LEMBKES – Geschichte einer Mecklenburger Familie" Autor: 
2 CONT Dirk Schäfer: 
2 CONT This book was published  in  2018 by "MFP-Verlag-Tellow (gemeinnütziger Verlag des Vereins für Mecklenburgische Familien- und Personengeschichte e. V."
2 CONT
2 CONT The autor writes: “The Lembke family originates from the german island Poel and expanded to the cities of Wismar and Lübeck. The branch of the island of Poel remained farmers, whereas the Lemkes of Wismar and Lübeck were alle merc
2 CONC hants or jurists. Many mayors (Bürgermeister) of Wismar, Lübeck, Mülheim/Ruhr) have roots in this familiy, "
