1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Roelof KIERSTEDE m. Eyke ROOSA 1. Wientie b. 25 Mar 1673, Kingston, NY 2. Lucas b. 24 Dec 1679, Kingston 3. Blandina b. 11 Jan 1682, m.(25 Nov 1704, Kingston) Conradt ELMENDORF 4. Aldert b. 16 Aug 1684, Kingston 5.
2 CONC  Aldert b. 16 Nov 1685, Kingston, m. (26 Oct 1714) Ariantje DELAMATER a. Sara b. 13 May 1716, Kingston b. Abraham b. 22 Sep 1717, Kingston c. Elsje b. 8 Mar 1719, Kingston
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannes (John) KIERSTEDE m. (9 Nov 1701, Kingston) Ariantje TAPPEN 1. Roelof b. 24 Jan 1703 2. Sara b. 8 Sep 1704, Kingston 3. Christoffel b. 23 Feb 1707, Kingston 4. Helena b. 4 Nov 1711, Kingston 5. Christoffel b. 24 Jan 1714, Ki
2 CONC ngston 6. Cornelia b. 22 July 1716, Kingston 7. Ariantjen b. 15 Oct 1721, Kingston
2 CONT
2 CONT I am not positive that I transcribed the names of the two last children of Roelof and Eyke; they may not both be named Aldert. If there’s only one Aldert, then that one is the father of the three children. Wientie was not in this 
2 CONC record. Charles Hollander, 2010
2 CONT ====
2 CONT from David Baker, 2013: "Roelof's father was Hans Kierstede who came to New Amsterdam with Director Keif in 1638. He married Sara Roelofs in Manhattan 29 June 1642. "  David Jacobowitz
2 CONT --------------------
