1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Petrus Bayard (died 1690) son of Samuel Bayard to Ann Stuyvesant; married Nov. 4, 1674, Blandina Kierstede, who died in New York in 1702. She was daughter of Surgeon or Doctor Hans Kierstede, of Magdeburg, who marr
2 CONC ied, June 29, 1642, Sarah Roelofs, a daughter of Jans Roelofs by his marriage to the celebrated heiress, Anneka Jans.
2 CONT
2 CONT Petrus Bayard and Blandina Kierstede had:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Samuel Bayard, born 1675, New Amsterdam; moved in 1698 to''' Bohemia Mano'''r, Cecil County, Maryland; married first, Susannah Bouchelle, born 1677; married second, Elizabeth Sluyter. He died Nov. 21, 1721. 
2 CONT
2 CONT # Petrus Bayard, owner of land in Ulster County, New York, married and had a son : Capt. Richard Bayard ; married, about Oct. 5, 1696, Rachel Van Bolen. 
2 CONT
2 CONT # Sarah Bayard. 
2 CONT
2 CONT James Bayard. 
2 CONT
